  "spec": "ASER 2024 reading tool (Tamil). Letters: commonly used letters (vowels and consonant letters with their inherent vowel), 5 per card. Words: familiar words of 2-3 letters, no grantha letters, 5 per card. Paragraph (Std I level): 4 linked sentences of at most 6 words. Story (Std II level): 7-10 linked sentences. Original text written for LevelOS (parallel to the Hindi bank for comparable difficulty), not copied from ASER Centre tools.",
  "instructions": {
    "letter": { "ta": "இந்த எழுத்துகளை ஒவ்வொன்றாகப் படி.", "hi": "इन अक्षरों को एक-एक करके पढ़ो।", "en": "Read these letters one by one." },
    "word": { "ta": "இந்தச் சொற்களை ஒவ்வொன்றாகப் படி.", "hi": "इन शब्दों को एक-एक करके पढ़ो।", "en": "Read these words one by one." },
    "paragraph": { "ta": "இதை உரக்கப் படி. விரலை வைத்துப் படிக்கலாம்.", "hi": "इसे ज़ोर से पढ़ो। उँगली रखकर पढ़ सकते हो।", "en": "Read this aloud. You can keep your finger on the words." },
    "story": { "ta": "இந்தக் கதையை உரக்கப் படி.", "hi": "यह कहानी ज़ोर से पढ़ो।", "en": "Read this story aloud." }
  },
